# Allow-list alternative (stricter): https://github.com/github/gitignore/blob/main/community/Golang/Go.AllowList.gitignore

# --- Go build & test artifacts ---
*.exe
*.exe~
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.a
*.o
*.test
*.prof
*.pprof
cpu.prof
mem.prof
coverage.*
*.coverprofile
profile.cov
coverage.html

# Fuzzing
testdata/fuzz/**/*
!testdata/fuzz/**/.gitkeep

# Delve / some IDEs
__debug_bin
__debug_bin_*

# --- Future / common output directories (binaries, releases, packagers) ---
/bin/
/build/
/dist/
/out/
/artifacts/
/target/
/release/
/tmp/
/temp/

# If you later vendor dependencies (uncomment to ignore the tree)
# vendor/

# Go workspace (local multi-module experiments)
go.work
go.work.sum

# --- Environment & secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# --- Tooling caches (if created inside the repo) ---
.cache/

# --- Logs & OS noise ---
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Editor / IDE (uncomment what you use) ---
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*~

# Cursor: this template commits .cursor/ (rules, skills, agent notes). Do not ignore it here.

# Roadmap removed from template; keep local copies out of git if you recreate the path
/docs/ROADMAP.md

# --- Optional: uncomment when you add these stacks ---
# node_modules/
# .terraform/
# *.tfstate*
